    "detailed_description": "Takki Jump is a challenging 3D-platformer with raging potential.<br><br>But what the hell is a Takki and why would it even jump? Find out in Takki Jump!<br>In this first person jump and run you slip into the role of a Takki and accompany him on the biggest journey of his life. Master difficult jumps and show nerves of steel. Compare your performance with Takkis all over the world and try to climb the leaderboard by becoming faster and better.<br><br>Gameplay:<br>Jump through different themed levels with increasing difficulty, jump on different platforms with special effects and solve small puzzles to enjoy the cute story this game has in store for you.<br><br>What this game offers you:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 7 unique and challenging level<br></li><li> A Jump and Run from first person perspective<br></li><li> Extremely difficult jumps and challenges<br></li><li> A thrilling and funny story<br></li><li> Collectibles all over the world<br></li><li> Steam leaderboards to set new records and beat old ones</li></ul>",
